  open \(V \subseteq X\) the section module \(\Gamma(\mathcal{F}, V)\) is a
  finite \(\Gamma(X, V)\)-module.

\textit{Source: Stacks~\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01HH}{01HH}
